  "html": "<h2 id=\"Japanese\">Japanese</h2><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3><p>Shortening of earlier <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A6%E6%A7%98#Japanese\" title=\"左様\"><ruby>左<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>様<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%B0#Japanese\" title=\"ならば\">ならば</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i>sayō naraba</i></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, itself a compound of <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A6%E6%A7%98#Japanese\" title=\"左様\"><ruby>左<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>様<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i>sayō</i></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/like_that\" title=\"like that\">like that</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/that_way\" title=\"that way\">that way</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> + <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%B0#Japanese\" title=\"ならば\">ならば</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i>naraba</i></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/if\" title=\"if\">if</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span>, <span class=\"ann-pos\">now somewhat archaic, often replaced by <span class=\"Jpan\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89#Japanese\" title=\"なら\">なら</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"tr\"><i>nara</i></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KDJ&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KDJ-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Literally, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">if that's the way it is</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span>.\n</p>",
